        <item>
            <title>0.8.1</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:15:39 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## 三个档位全部开放

- 设置 › AI 服务里「省钱」「效果优先」现在可以直接选：
  - 省钱：AI 选片换成更便宜的模型，找杂物和对话改图仍用准的 Gemini
  - 效果优先：看图的每一步都用更强的 GPT-6.1 Sol，更慢也更贵
- 这两个档位还没用实拍测过；选的模型出错或回复格式不对时，会自动换回推荐模型再试一次
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/fulisadawang/aiphoto/releases/download/v0.8.1/AIPhoto-0.8.1.zip" length="5660224" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="NCJvQl+lrPq8yEzHYc8Pb+FTT+CoKrZEI8sNPh5gj4zicB2U4J9iAiqdzn4oV+ruyNBTE1/Ugc+oUNCib3V8AQ=="/>
